<h2>G. Performance Evaluation Metrics</h2>
<p>Model performance is evaluated across five mathematical measures:</p>

<div class="equation">
Accuracy = (&sum;<sub><i>i</i>=1</sub><sup><i>N</i></sup> &Iopf;(<i>y&#770;<sub>i</sub></i> = <i>y<sub>i</sub></i>) / <i>N</i>) &times; 100% &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (9)
</div>
<div class="equation">
Macro Precision = (1 / <i>K</i>) &sum;<sub><i>c</i>=1</sub><sup><i>K</i></sup> (<i>TP<sub>c</sub></i> / (<i>TP<sub>c</sub></i> + <i>FP<sub>c</sub></i>)) &times; 100% &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (10)
</div>
<div class="equation">
Macro Recall = (1 / <i>K</i>) &sum;<sub><i>c</i>=1</sub><sup><i>K</i></sup> (<i>TP<sub>c</sub></i> / (<i>TP<sub>c</sub></i> + <i>FN<sub>c</sub></i>)) &times; 100% &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (11)
</div>
<div class="equation">
Macro F1 = (1 / <i>K</i>) &sum;<sub><i>c</i>=1</sub><sup><i>K</i></sup> (2 &middot; <i>P<sub>c</sub></i> &middot; <i>R<sub>c</sub></i> / (<i>P<sub>c</sub></i> + <i>R<sub>c</sub></i>)) &times; 100% &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (12)
</div>

<p class="noindent">Inference Latency (<i>T</i><sub>inf</sub>) represents the average offline CPU execution time per complete 24-frame continuous sequence in milliseconds (ms/seq).</p>

